flowchart TD
    REQ[Upload analysis request or user query] --> O[Orchestrator]
    O --> R[RAG retrieval<br/>project-scoped evidence]
    R --> E[Evidence passages<br/>with source references]

    E --> S[Scope and Deliverable<br/>Extraction Agent]
    E --> B[Blocker and Action Item<br/>Identification Agent]
    S --> V[Validate structure, evidence,<br/>and unresolved questions]
    B --> V
    V --> D[Current project records<br/>tasks and milestones]
    V --> RF[Risk Detection and Delivery<br/>Forecasting Agent]
    D --> RF
    S --> RF
    B --> RF
    RF --> RV[Validate risk evidence,<br/>assumptions, and uncertainty]

    V --> DOC[Documentation Generation Agent]
    RV --> DOC
    DOC --> DV[Validate draft and citations]
    DV --> STORE[(Evidence-linked project findings<br/>and draft documents)]
    RV --> STORE
    V --> STORE
    STORE --> DASH[Dashboard and reports]

    O --> DIRECT{Question needs<br/>specialized analysis?}
    DIRECT -->|No| GEN[LLM response generation<br/>from retrieved context]
    DIRECT -->|Yes| E
    GEN --> ANSWER[Assistant answer<br/>with citations or evidence gap]
    DV --> ANSWER
    ANSWER --> USER[Project team member]
    DASH --> USER
